    "<div class=\"beui-frame\" style=\"left:50px;top:4px;\">",
    "<div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:208px;height:16px;font:normal 400 14px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(230,235,243,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:16px;line-height:16px;\">",
    "Alt moves and resizes windows</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div class=\"beui-frame\" style=\"left:0px;top:36px;\">",
    "<div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:522.1094px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "A dock can be given a drag modifier, which is off unless asked for. While it is held, dragging </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:14px;width:533.3594px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0.109375px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "anywhere in a window, its bar and tabs included, moves the whole window, and dragging with </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:28px;width:541.5px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0.359375px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "the right button resizes it from its nearest edge or corner, or moves the split nearest the pointer </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:42px;width:531.0156px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:-0.5px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "in a docked pane. Nothing in the dock or its tabs sees those presses. The Linux desktop uses </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:56px;width:36.34375px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0.015625px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
